          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"events\":{\"items\":[{\"id\":5035,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Asafeer Launch Night: Palestinian Short Films, Panel Talk & Fundraiser for Gaza\",\"en\":\"Asafeer Launch Night: Palestinian Short Films, Panel Talk & Fundraiser for Gaza\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>📍 Edami, London</p><p> 📅 Friday 6 November 2026</p><p> 🕕 6pm – 10:30pm</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Asafeer is a new UK charity supporting displaced families from Gaza, across Palestine and Lebanon, alongside food relief distributions on the ground. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Join us as we celebrate our launch with an evening of Palestinian film, conversation, music and community, raising funds for families in Gaza and the Gaza Food Relief Project.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>What to expect</strong></p><p>🎬 <strong>Film screenings (from 7.45pm):</strong> two award-winning Palestinian shorts, <em>Maradona’s Leg</em> and <em>An Orange from Jaffa</em>, generously donated by their directors and producers</p><p> 🎙️ <strong>Panel talk</strong> with Sarah Agha and Bisan Alhajhasan</p><p> 🎶 <strong>Social</strong> with music by Adan</p><p> 🛍️ <strong>Market stall</strong> with Palestinian products from Wanas Space, Najlaa Jarbou and Thobnah, plus Asafeer merch</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Where your money goes</strong></p><p> All ticket proceeds go directly to families in Gaza and the Gaza Food Relief Project.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Tickets</strong></p><p>Spaces are limited, so please book early.</p><p> </p><p>Can’t make it on the night? Choose the </p><p><strong>donation-only ticket</strong> to support from afar. Every contribution makes a difference.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>📍 Edami, London</p><p> 📅 Friday 6 November 2026</p><p> 🕕 6pm – 10:30pm</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Asafeer is a new UK charity supporting displaced families from Gaza, across Palestine and Lebanon, alongside food relief distributions on the ground. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Join us as we celebrate our launch with an evening of Palestinian film, conversation, music and community, raising funds for families in Gaza and the Gaza Food Relief Project.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>What to expect</strong></p><p>🎬 <strong>Film screenings (from 7.45pm):</strong> two award-winning Palestinian shorts, <em>Maradona’s Leg</em> and <em>An Orange from Jaffa</em>, generously donated by their directors and producers</p><p> 🎙️ <strong>Panel talk</strong> with Sarah Agha and Bisan Alhajhasan</p><p> 🎶 <strong>Social</strong> with music by Adan</p><p> 🛍️ <strong>Market stall</strong> with Palestinian products from Wanas Space, Najlaa Jarbou and Thobnah, plus Asafeer merch</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Where your money goes</strong></p><p> All ticket proceeds go directly to families in Gaza and the Gaza Food Relief Project.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Tickets</strong></p><p>Spaces are limited, so please book early.</p><p> </p><p>Can’t make it on the night? Choose the </p><p><strong>donation-only ticket</strong> to support from afar. Every contribution makes a difference.</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/ly6Lkik4Tq4JI0qChWLVbJ6FnzgR9Nz54wAvPEOX.jpg\",\"images\":{\"instagram_story\":\"images/gP90tjBuTquoPjsbKvb7Kb6XuirhI3cmcDXks9SJ.png\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"EDAMI\",\"en\":\"EDAMI\"},\"place_id\":1014,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"asafeer-launch-night-palestinian-short-films-panel-talk-fundraiser-for-gaza\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-06 16:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-06 20:30\",\"ticket_types\":[{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"GeneralAdmissionwithshortfilmscreeningaccess_0\",\"color\":null,\"index\":0,\"price\":\"7\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":null,\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"General Admission with short film screening access\",\"label_en\":\"General Admission with short film screening access\",\"pay_free\":false,\"quantity\":\"65\",\"description\":null,\"hide_ticket\":false,\"pay_as_need\":true,\"max_quantity\":\"6\",\"min_quantity\":\"\",\"sell_to_time\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"sell_end_date\":null,\"ticket_active\":false,\"description_ar\":\"<p>All revenue from tickets will go towards the families in Gaza and Gaza Food Relief Project</p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p>All revenue from tickets will go towards the families in Gaza and Gaza Food Relief Project</p>\",\"sell_from_date\":null,\"sell_from_time\":null,\"disable_selling\":false,\"exchange_prices\":{\"AED\":34.72,\"AUD\":13.53,\"EUR\":8.42,\"GBP\":7,\"ILS\":29.99,\"JOD\":6.72,\"TRY\":473.16,\"USD\":9.46},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":null,\"ticket_type_name\":\"other\",\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":\"1\"},\"ticket_type_name_other\":\"\"},{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"OpenDonation_1\",\"color\":null,\"index\":1,\"price\":\"5\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":null,\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"Open Donation\",\"label_en\":\"Open Donation\",\"pay_free\":false,\"quantity\":\"300\",\"description\":null,\"hide_ticket\":false,\"pay_as_need\":true,\"max_quantity\":\"100\",\"sell_to_time\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"sell_end_date\":null,\"ticket_active\":false,\"description_ar\":\"<p>Can't make it but would like to donate or you simply want to donate more? use this ticket option!</p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p>Can't make it but would like to donate or you simply want to donate more? use this ticket option!</p>\",\"sell_from_date\":null,\"sell_from_time\":null,\"disable_selling\":false,\"exchange_prices\":{\"AED\":24.8,\"AUD\":9.66,\"EUR\":6.01,\"GBP\":5,\"ILS\":21.42,\"JOD\":4.8,\"TRY\":337.97,\"USD\":6.76},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":null,\"ticket_type_name\":\"other\",\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":\"5\"}},{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"PreandPostScreening-noshortfilmaccess_2\",\"color\":null,\"index\":2,\"price\":\"4\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":null,\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"Pre and Post Screening - no short film access\",\"label_en\":\"Pre and Post Screening - no short film access\",\"pay_free\":false,\"quantity\":\"25\",\"description\":null,\"hide_ticket\":false,\"pay_as_need\":true,\"max_quantity\":\"9\",\"sell_to_time\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"sell_end_date\":null,\"ticket_active\":false,\"description_ar\":\"<p>We cannot accomodate more than a fixed amount of people during the screening but before and after people are welcome to come and enjoy the music, socialise, eat and drink and also browse our market stalls. This ticket is for that entry exclusively from 6 to 7.30 and from 9.30 to 10.30 x </p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p>We cannot accomodate more than a fixed amount of people during the screening but before and after people are welcome to come and enjoy the music, socialise, eat and drink and also browse our market stalls. This ticket is for that entry exclusively from 6 to 7.30 and from 9.30 to 10.30 x </p>\",\"sell_from_date\":null,\"sell_from_time\":null,\"disable_selling\":false,\"exchange_prices\":{\"AED\":19.84,\"AUD\":7.73,\"EUR\":4.81,\"GBP\":4,\"ILS\":17.14,\"JOD\":3.84,\"TRY\":270.38,\"USD\":5.41},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":null,\"ticket_type_name\":\"other\",\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":null}}],\"category_id\":20,\"user_id\":105252,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T10:11:16.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":{\"AED\":19.84,\"AUD\":7.73,\"EUR\":4.81,\"GBP\":4,\"ILS\":17.14,\"JOD\":3.84,\"TRY\":270.38,\"USD\":5.41},\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"regular\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"<p><em>[time changed]</em></p><p><strong>6:00pm</strong> Doors open, market stall, food and drinks</p><p><strong>7:30pm</strong> Welcome and introduction to Asafeer</p><p><strong>7:45pm</strong> Screenings: <em>Maradona’s Leg</em> and <em>An Orange from Jaffa</em></p><p><strong>8:45pm</strong> Panel talk with Sarah Agha &amp; Bisan Alhajhasan</p><p><strong>9:30pm until closing</strong> Social with music by Adan</p>\",\"en\":\"<p><em>[time changed]</em></p><p><strong>6:00pm</strong> Doors open, market stall, food and drinks</p><p><strong>7:30pm</strong> Welcome and introduction to Asafeer</p><p><strong>7:45pm</strong> Screenings: <em>Maradona’s Leg</em> and <em>An Orange from Jaffa</em></p><p><strong>8:45pm</strong> Panel talk with Sarah Agha &amp; Bisan Alhajhasan</p><p><strong>9:30pm until closing</strong> Social with music by Adan</p>\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"356589911773\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T18:18:42.688507Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Asafeer Launch Night: Palestinian Short Films, Panel Talk & Fundraiser for Gaza\",\"start_date\":\"Fri, Nov 6, 2026 6:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":\"$5\",\"current_step\":\"success\",\"event_type\":\"regular\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":true,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":true},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/5035?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"أمسيات\",\"en\":\"Evenings\"},\"parent_id\":35,\"slug\":\"evenings\",\"label\":\"Evenings\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":1014,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"EDAMI | EDAMI\",\"slug\":\"edami-edami\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"EDAMI\",\"en\":\"EDAMI\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5525048\",\"longitude\":\"-0.0712408\",\"address\":\"73-75 Shacklewell Ln, London E8 2EB, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T10:04:48.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-21T10:04:48.000000Z\",\"user_id\":105252,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-06\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-06\",\"from_time_only\":\"06:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"10:30 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":5074,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Rhythm Race Revolution | Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation\",\"en\":\"Rhythm Race Revolution | Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>“<strong>This work is a true embodiment of liberation. My practice puts the power back into your hands and supports you in holding it.” - </strong>Nana Sharifa Ageno Bryan</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation is a two-part, place-based activation of Black indigenous liberatory pedagogy and spiritual technology.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Flowing through co-created installation, collective sound and movement, writing exercises, and group reflection, informed by Afrodiasporic and Caribbean healing traditions, this restorative practice will provide participants with new tools and understanding that will be carried into their personal and community work.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Participants will partake in collective cleansing and community ancestor altar building rituals that disempower colonial narratives of belonging, while uplifting ancestral memory, legacy, and wisdom.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Day One: Here, We Belong&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Commencing with a brief artist talk, Nana Sharifa “Ageno” Bryan will explore the importance of energetic cleansings throughout indigenous traditions and how specific rituals are used to empower individuals, families, and communities.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Participants will then be guided into a ceremonial purification of the space in preparation for Day Two’s community altar installation.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Please wear white or light-colored clothing.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>What to Expect:</p><p>Movement of the body</p><p>Activation of voice</p><p>Handling of herbs, incense, resins</p><p>Sound-making&nbsp;</p><p>Creative writing/journaling&nbsp;</p><p>Collective reflection&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><em>*Participants are strongly encouraged to attend both events to maximize their experience, but it is not required. </em></strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">RSVP TO DAY TWO </span><a href=\\\"https://tzkrti.com/en/events/5075\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></a></p>\",\"en\":\"<p>“<strong>This work is a true embodiment of liberation. My practice puts the power back into your hands and supports you in holding it.” - </strong>Nana Sharifa Ageno Bryan</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation is a two-part, place-based activation of Black indigenous liberatory pedagogy and spiritual technology.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Flowing through co-created installation, collective sound and movement, writing exercises, and group reflection, informed by Afrodiasporic and Caribbean healing traditions, this restorative practice will provide participants with new tools and understanding that will be carried into their personal and community work.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Participants will partake in collective cleansing and community ancestor altar building rituals that disempower colonial narratives of belonging, while uplifting ancestral memory, legacy, and wisdom.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Day One: Here, We Belong&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Commencing with a brief artist talk, Nana Sharifa “Ageno” Bryan will explore the importance of energetic cleansings throughout indigenous traditions and how specific rituals are used to empower individuals, families, and communities.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Participants will then be guided into a ceremonial purification of the space in preparation for Day Two’s community altar installation.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Please wear white or light-colored clothing.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>What to Expect:</p><p>Movement of the body</p><p>Activation of voice</p><p>Handling of herbs, incense, resins</p><p>Sound-making&nbsp;</p><p>Creative writing/journaling&nbsp;</p><p>Collective reflection&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><em>*Participants are strongly encouraged to attend both events to maximize their experience, but it is not required. </em></strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">RSVP TO DAY TWO </span><a href=\\\"https://tzkrti.com/en/events/5075\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></a></p>\"},\"image\":\"images/YlQaPkHO2TilKhee1DOoFzTA9bOo03e33hA5NjmP.jpg\",\"images\":{\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"place_id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"rhythm-race-revolution-sounding-towards-trumpets-of-collective-liberation\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-11 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-11 20:00\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":1,\"user_id\":59377,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T10:26:54.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":1,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":[],\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"rsvp\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"359663943360\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T17:30:13.196716Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Rhythm Race Revolution | Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation\",\"start_date\":\"Wed, Nov 11, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":null,\"current_step\":\"rsvp\",\"event_type\":\"rsvp\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":false},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/5074?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"موسيقى\",\"en\":\"Music\"},\"parent_id\":26,\"slug\":\"music\",\"label\":\"Music\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"Mosaic Rooms | Mosaic Rooms\",\"slug\":\"mosaic-rooms-mosaic-rooms\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.4949507\",\"longitude\":\"-0.1952534\",\"address\":\"226 Cromwell Rd, London SW5 0SW, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"user_id\":59377,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-11\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-11\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"10:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":5075,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Rhythm Race Revolution | Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation Day 2\",\"en\":\"Rhythm Race Revolution | Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation Day 2\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Day Two: </strong><strong>Calling Egungun - Collective Ancestors</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nana Sharifa “Ageno” Bryan will discuss the framework of ancestral veneration in indigenous cultures, its essential role in maintaining balance in life, and how ancestral veneration is a tool for collective liberation.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Through song, prayer, and sacred remembrance, participants will build a collective ancestor altar, elevating those that came before us to conjure new future possibilities.&nbsp; Following the installation, a reflective journaling and talk back session regrounds us in our bodies and the present, while offering takeaways to inspire the work ahead.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Please wear white or light-coloured clothing.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>*Participants will bring the names of up to five deceased loved ones to honor in this activation. In addition, personal items representing those selected relatives are welcomed (i.e. framed photographs, jewellery, keepsakes, and other memorabilia). All personal items will be returned at the end of the evening.&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">**In the spirit of community, we also ask participants to contribute offerings to the collective altar in the form of fresh flowers, small bottles of wine/spirits, candles (of any color), fresh fruits, candies, and/or sweets.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">What to Expect:</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Movement of the body</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Activation of voice through song and prayer&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Engaging with sacred herbal mixtures, waters, incense, and resins</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Somatic responses to ceremony</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Creative writing/journaling</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Collective reflection&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">RSVP TO DAY ONE </span><a href=\\\"https://tzkrti.com/en/events/5074\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></a></p>\",\"en\":\"<p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Day Two: </strong><strong>Calling Egungun - Collective Ancestors</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nana Sharifa “Ageno” Bryan will discuss the framework of ancestral veneration in indigenous cultures, its essential role in maintaining balance in life, and how ancestral veneration is a tool for collective liberation.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Through song, prayer, and sacred remembrance, participants will build a collective ancestor altar, elevating those that came before us to conjure new future possibilities.&nbsp; Following the installation, a reflective journaling and talk back session regrounds us in our bodies and the present, while offering takeaways to inspire the work ahead.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Please wear white or light-coloured clothing.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>*Participants will bring the names of up to five deceased loved ones to honor in this activation. In addition, personal items representing those selected relatives are welcomed (i.e. framed photographs, jewellery, keepsakes, and other memorabilia). All personal items will be returned at the end of the evening.&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">**In the spirit of community, we also ask participants to contribute offerings to the collective altar in the form of fresh flowers, small bottles of wine/spirits, candles (of any color), fresh fruits, candies, and/or sweets.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">What to Expect:</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Movement of the body</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Activation of voice through song and prayer&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Engaging with sacred herbal mixtures, waters, incense, and resins</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Somatic responses to ceremony</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Creative writing/journaling</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Collective reflection&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">RSVP TO DAY ONE </span><a href=\\\"https://tzkrti.com/en/events/5074\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></a></p>\"},\"image\":\"images/SW4PzN1HTv0ISPoFLdtNiqYUaLtTYjgyp2dfR8R2.jpg\",\"images\":{\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"place_id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"rhythm-race-revolution-sounding-towards-trumpets-of-collective-liberation-day-2\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-13 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-13 20:00\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":1,\"user_id\":59377,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T10:31:58.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":1,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":[],\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"rsvp\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"359286257376\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T17:28:24.094845Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Rhythm Race Revolution | Sounding Towards: Trumpets of Collective Liberation Day 2\",\"start_date\":\"Fri, Nov 13, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":null,\"current_step\":\"rsvp\",\"event_type\":\"rsvp\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":false},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/5075?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"موسيقى\",\"en\":\"Music\"},\"parent_id\":26,\"slug\":\"music\",\"label\":\"Music\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"Mosaic Rooms | Mosaic Rooms\",\"slug\":\"mosaic-rooms-mosaic-rooms\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.4949507\",\"longitude\":\"-0.1952534\",\"address\":\"226 Cromwell Rd, London SW5 0SW, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"user_id\":59377,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-13\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-13\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"10:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4875,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"LAUNCH EVENT: Decolonising the Page: A Forgotten Golden Age of Arabic Book Arts (1950s-80s)\",\"en\":\"LAUNCH EVENT: Decolonising the Page: A Forgotten Golden Age of Arabic Book Arts (1950s-80s)\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>Join us for a special launch event of <a href=\\\"https://www.decolonizingthepage.com/en\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><em>Decolonizing the Page: A Forgotten Golden Age of Arabic Book Arts (1950s–80s)</em></a>, a new online exhibition and archival resource exploring a remarkable period of Arabic book arts emerging from the artistic, political, and intellectual ferment of decolonization across the Arab world.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p> The launch will start with a panel of presentations featuring researcher and curator <strong>Zeina Maasri</strong>, the design team, <strong>Sophie Demay, Jana Traboulsi </strong>and<strong> Erik Hartin, </strong>alongside<strong> Daniel Lowe</strong> from the <strong>British Library</strong>. This will be followed by a conversation chaired by <strong>Venetia Porter</strong>. Highlights include a screening of <strong>Kais al-Zubaidi</strong>’s short <em>Testimony of Palestinian Children in Wartime</em> (1972, 18’).&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p> Bring a book from your own library and participate in a show and tell curated with <strong>Maqam Books</strong> before we celebrate with refreshments.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p> This event is a collaboration between <strong>University of Bristol, British Library, Maqam Books and Mosaic Rooms.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Decolonizing the Page was funded by an Arts and Humanities Research Council Fellowship, UK [grant number AH/W011190/1] and developed in partnership with Abboudi Bou Jawde (Al-Furat, Beirut), the British Library, and Azzawi Archives (London).</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Image: Courtesy of Decolonising the Page team.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>Join us for a special launch event of <a href=\\\"https://www.decolonizingthepage.com/en\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><em>Decolonizing the Page: A Forgotten Golden Age of Arabic Book Arts (1950s–80s)</em></a>, a new online exhibition and archival resource exploring a remarkable period of Arabic book arts emerging from the artistic, political, and intellectual ferment of decolonization across the Arab world.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p> The launch will start with a panel of presentations featuring researcher and curator <strong>Zeina Maasri</strong>, the design team, <strong>Sophie Demay, Jana Traboulsi </strong>and<strong> Erik Hartin, </strong>alongside<strong> Daniel Lowe</strong> from the <strong>British Library</strong>. This will be followed by a conversation chaired by <strong>Venetia Porter</strong>. Highlights include a screening of <strong>Kais al-Zubaidi</strong>’s short <em>Testimony of Palestinian Children in Wartime</em> (1972, 18’).&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p> Bring a book from your own library and participate in a show and tell curated with <strong>Maqam Books</strong> before we celebrate with refreshments.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p> This event is a collaboration between <strong>University of Bristol, British Library, Maqam Books and Mosaic Rooms.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Decolonizing the Page was funded by an Arts and Humanities Research Council Fellowship, UK [grant number AH/W011190/1] and developed in partnership with Abboudi Bou Jawde (Al-Furat, Beirut), the British Library, and Azzawi Archives (London).</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Image: Courtesy of Decolonising the Page team.</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/zSXM9aTRdnGTjtFjndZfaGz2MBePoOOaCWKyEEli.png\",\"images\":{\"instagram_story\":\"images/Zm4KHQlBcpXI3GPElwCEkReIdzm6f2Nox9yHRyw2.png\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"place_id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"launch-event-decolonising-the-page-a-forgotten-golden-age-of-arabic-book-arts-1950s-80s\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-14 13:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-14 16:00\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":2,\"user_id\":59377,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T13:26:17.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":1,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":[],\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"rsvp\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"352638183140\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-10-29T17:49:21.331531Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"LAUNCH EVENT: Decolonising the Page: A Forgotten Golden Age of Arabic Book Arts (1950s-80s)\",\"start_date\":\"Sat, Nov 14, 2026 3:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":null,\"current_step\":\"rsvp\",\"event_type\":\"rsvp\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":false},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/4875?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"فن\",\"en\":\"Art\"},\"parent_id\":32,\"slug\":\"art\",\"label\":\"Art\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"Mosaic Rooms | Mosaic Rooms\",\"slug\":\"mosaic-rooms-mosaic-rooms\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.4949507\",\"longitude\":\"-0.1952534\",\"address\":\"226 Cromwell Rd, London SW5 0SW, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"user_id\":59377,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"from_time_only\":\"03:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"06:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4730,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"نعيمة الجزاءرية\",\"en\":\"Naima Dziria\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>&nbsp;َنعِيمة دزيرية – أمسية استثنائية من الموسيقى الجزائرية</p><p>استمتعوا بجمال الموسيقى الجزائرية الخالد مع الصوت الأيقوني للفنانة نعيمة دزيرية.</p><p>انضموا إلينا في أمسية لا تُنسى، نحتفي فيها بالأصالة والمشاعر وروح المشاركة، بمشاركة المطربة الجزائرية القديرة نعيمة دزيرية.</p><p>تشتهر نعيمة دزيرية بصوتها الساحر وإتقانها الاستثنائي لفنَّي الحوزي والشعبي، وستأخذكم في رحلة فنية آسرة عبر التراث الموسيقي الجزائري الغني. وستؤدي مجموعة من أشهر أغانيها، لتمنحكم تجربة غامرة مليئة بالشغف والحنين والألحان التي لا تُنسى.</p><p>سواء كنتم ترغبون في الاحتفاء بتراثنا الثقافي أو قضاء أمسية مميزة مع العائلة والأصدقاء، فإن هذا الموعد لا يُفوَّت.</p><p>تفاصيل الفعالية</p><p>📅 التاريخ: السبت 14 نوفمبر 2026</p><p>⏰ فتح الأبواب: الساعة 7:00 مساءً</p><p>📍 المكان: Royal Nawaab</p><p>7 Western Avenue, UB6 8DB</p><p>🎤 الحفل الغنائي: نعيمة دزيرية</p><p>بمرافقة نخبة من موسيقييها:</p><p>* 🎹 عازف البيانو: عز الدين</p><p>* 🥁 عازف الدربوكة: يسري</p><p>* 🎻 عازف الكمان: منير</p><p>* 🎶 سيد أحمد باهي</p><p>الضيف الخاص: 🎧 DJ حكيم</p><p>تجربة العشاء والحفل</p><p>🍽️ استمتعوا بأمسية تجمع بين الموسيقى الجزائرية الحية، والمأكولات الشهية، والعروض الترفيهية المميزة.</p><p>تشمل باقة العشاء والحفل:</p><p>* الدخول إلى الفعالية</p><p>* مقبلات</p><p>* طبق رئيسي</p><p>* حلوى</p><p>* مشروب</p><p>]</p><p>📞 للاستفسار / واتساب: 07849 063355</p><p>⸻</p><p>⚠️ الأماكن محدودة</p><p>يُنصح بشدة بالحجز المسبق لضمان حضوركم في هذه الاحتفالية الاستثنائية بالموسيقى والثقافة الجزائرية.</p><p>تعالوا واختبروا سحر نعيمة دزيرية مباشرةً على المسرح!</p><p>أمسية من الموسيقى والتراث والذكريات التي لا تُنسى في انتظاركم</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>NAÏMA DZIRIA ( l’icône de la chanson Algéroise)– AN EXCEPTIONAL EVENING OF ALGERIAN MUSIC</p><p>Experience the timeless beauty of Algerian music with the iconic voice of Naïma Dziria.</p><p>Join us for an unforgettable evening celebrating authenticity, emotion, and togetherness, featuring the legendary Algerian singer Naïma Dziria.</p><p>Renowned for her enchanting voice and exceptional mastery of the Hawzi and Chaâbi musical traditions, Naïma Dziria will take you on a captivating journey through the rich heritage of Algerian music. She will perform some of her greatest hits, creating an immersive experience filled with passion, nostalgia, and unforgettable melodies.</p><p>Whether you are looking to celebrate our cultural heritage or enjoy a special evening with family and friends, this is an event not to be missed.</p><p>EVENT DETAILS</p><p>📅 Date: Saturday, 14 November 2026</p><p>⏰ Doors Open: 7:00 PM</p><p>📍 Venue: Royal Nawaab</p><p>7 Western Avenue, UB6 8DB</p><p>🎤 Live Performance by: Naïma Dziria</p><p>Accompanied by her talented musicians:</p><p>• 🎹 Pianist: Azzedine</p><p>• 🥁 Derbouka: Yousri</p><p>• 🎻 Violin: Mounir</p><p>• 🎶 Sidahmed Bahi</p><p>Special Guest: 🎧 DJ Hakim</p><p>DINNER &amp; SHOW EXPERIENCE</p><p>🍽️ Enjoy an evening of live Algerian music, great food, and unforgettable entertainment.</p><p>Dinner + Show Package Includes:</p><p>• Entry to the event</p><p>• Starter</p><p>• Main Course</p><p>• Dessert</p><p>📞 Infoline / WhatsApp: 07849 063355</p><p>────────</p><p>⚠️ LIMITED AVAILABILITY</p><p>Reservations are highly recommended to secure your place at this exceptional celebration of Algerian music and culture.</p><p>Come and experience the magic of Naïma Dziria live!</p><p>An evening of music, tradition, and unforgettable memories awaits you.</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/pqf8F0ycOZ5RgjPF9o2KHMykojrATZw6c7SQaYof.jpg\",\"images\":{\"youtube\":{\"id\":\"TAiy9rtFoLE\",\"link\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TAiy9rtFoLE\",\"resource\":\"\"},\"instagram_story\":\"images/e7FSCdguEPoAKEmrnQ8MAArjzM9PJgR5AvSX4VG0.jpg\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"رويال نواب\",\"en\":\"Royal Nawaab\"},\"place_id\":939,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"naima-dziria\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-14 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-14 21:30\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":1,\"user_id\":65410,\"published\":1,\"private\":0,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-15T11:00:26.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[{\"pricing\":[{\"key\":\"8yhyEGtKFmARYH7q\",\"layout\":\"price_item\",\"attributes\":{\"fees\":0,\"price\":\"90\",\"category\":\"1\",\"custom_data\":null,\"popover_info\":null}},{\"key\":\"xrzG5hbkAa3C2THr\",\"layout\":\"price_item\",\"attributes\":{\"fees\":0,\"price\":\"75\",\"category\":\"2\",\"custom_data\":null,\"popover_info\":null}}],\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"event_id\":\"1759ebd6-0e47-443d-adbf-8084dd022348\",\"gap_size\":\"0\",\"total_seats\":\"210\",\"pricing_type\":\"simple\",\"ComputedField\":\"Royal Nawaab\",\"additional_info\":\"\",\"uploaded_file_name\":\"Select seating chart\",\"selected_pricing_type\":\"tiered\",\"uploaded_seating_chart\":\"\",\"limited_ticket_type_limit\":null,\"limited_ticket_type_keyword\":null,\"limited_ticket_type_message\":null}],\"rsvp\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":{\"AED\":371.96,\"AUD\":144.93,\"EUR\":90.2,\"GBP\":75,\"ILS\":321.28,\"JOD\":71.96,\"TRY\":5069.59,\"USD\":101.35},\"cta_label\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\",\"external_link\":\"\"},\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"seats\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"<p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>أمسية من الأناقة والترفيه والمأكولات الاستثنائية</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">يسرّنا أن نرحّب بكم في أمسية مميزة تستضيفها <strong>فعاليات روستوميا</strong>، حيث نجمع العائلات والأصدقاء معًا لقضاء تجربة لا تُنسى.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">نظرًا لأن هذا الحدث عائلي، نرجو من جميع الضيوف الالتزام بارتداء الزي المناسب. ونشجّع الجميع على ارتداء ملابس أنيقة وملائمة لهذه المناسبة.</p><p><strong>تجربة تناول الطعام من رويال نواعم</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">سيستمتع ضيوفنا بتشكيلة رائعة من الأطباق المستوحاة من مطبخ رويال نواعم الشهير، وتشمل:</p><ul><li>مجموعة متنوعة من المقبلات الشهية، بما في ذلك الأسماك، وكباب اللحم، والسلطات الطازجة، وغيرها.</li><li>تشكيلة من الأطباق الرئيسية الفاخرة.</li><li>الشاي التقليدي مع تشكيلة لذيذة من الحلويات التقليدية.</li><li>المشروبات الغازية متوفرة طوال الأمسية.</li></ul><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">تضمن قائمتنا المختارة بعناية تجربة طعام مميزة لا تُنسى، تجمع بين النكهات الشهية والأطباق التقليدية المحبوبة.</p><p><strong>أمسية لا تُنسى</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">في فعاليات روستوميا، نحرص على توفير أجواء ممتعة ومرحّبة بالجميع. ومن خلال الطعام الشهي، والترفيه، ورفقة العائلة والأصدقاء، نهدف إلى جعل هذه الأمسية مناسبة مميزة بكل معنى الكلمة.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">نتطلع إلى لقائكم، ومشاركة أجمل اللحظات معًا، وصنع ذكريات تدوم مدى الحياة.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>فلنجعلها أمسية لا تُنسى!</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">مع أطيب التحيات،</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\"> <strong>فريق فعاليات روستوميا</strong></p>\",\"en\":\"<p>🎶 NAÏMA DZIRIA – EVENT PROGRAMME</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>An Unforgettable Evening of Algerian Music, Culture &amp; Entertainment</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Get ready for an exceptional evening filled with live music, delicious food, entertainment, and unforgettable moments with the legendary Naïma Dziria.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>✨ EVENING PROGRAMME</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>7:00 PM – Welcome &amp; Guest Arrival</p><p>Welcome to all our guests. Join us for a wonderful evening of music, celebration, and togetherness.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>7:15 PM – The Evening will be animated by Bach and Mourad </p><p>7:30 PM -DJ Hakim | Music &amp; Entertainment 🎧</p><p>Enjoy an exciting musical atmosphere with DJ Hakim as we set the mood for the evening.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>7:45 PM – Dinner Served 🍽️</p><p>Indulge in our delicious dinner experience and enjoy the company of family and friends.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>8:30 PM – Tea &amp; Dessert ☕🍰</p><p>Relax and enjoy a selection of tea and delightful desserts.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>9:00 PM – THE MAIN EVENT 🌟</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Naïma Dziria Takes the Stage!</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Experience the enchanting voice and timeless music of the iconic Algerian singer Naïma Dziria, accompanied by her talented musicians.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Get ready for an unforgettable live performance celebrating the rich heritage of Algerian Hawzi and Chaâbi music.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>11:15 PM – DJ Hakim | After-Show Entertainment 🎶</p><p>Keep the celebration going with more music and entertainment from DJ Hakim.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>11:45 PM – Event Concludes ✨</p><p>Thank you for joining us for this special evening.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>⸻</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>🎁 AND MORE SURPRISES TO FOLLOW!</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>We have more exciting surprises in store for you throughout the evening.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Stay tuned, enjoy the atmosphere, and make memories that will last a lifetime!</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Naïma Dziria Live in Concert</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>📅 Saturday, 14 November 2026</p><p>📍 Royal Nawaab, 7 Western Avenue, UB6 8DB</p><p>📞 Infoline / WhatsApp: 07849 063355</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Limited places available – Book your tickets now!</p>\"},\"language\":\"dual\",\"fees_shares\":{\"buyer\":\"0\",\"option\":\"organizer_all\",\"organizer\":\"100\"},\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"<p>An Evening of Elegance, Entertainment &amp; Exceptional Cuisine</p><p>We are delighted to welcome you to a special evening hosted by Rostomia Events, bringing families and friends together for an unforgettable experience.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>As a family-oriented event, we kindly request that all guests observe the dress code. We encourage everyone to dress elegantly and appropriately for the occasion.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>A Royal Nawaab Dining Experience</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Guests will enjoy a wonderful selection of dishes inspired by the renowned Royal Nawaab cuisine, featuring:</p><p>● A variety of delicious starters, including fish, lamb kebabs, fresh salads, and more.</p><p>● A selection of exquisite main courses.</p><p>● Traditional tea accompanied by a delightful assortment of traditional cakes.</p><p>● Soft drinks included throughout the evening.</p><p>Our carefully selected menu promises a memorable dining experience, bringing together delicious flavours and traditional favourites.</p><p>An Evening to Remember</p><p>At Rostomia Events, we are committed to creating an enjoyable and welcoming atmosphere for everyone. With great food, entertainment, and the company of family and friends, we aim to make this evening a truly special occasion.</p><p>We look forward to coming together, sharing wonderful moments, and creating memories that will last a lifetime.</p><p>Let’s make it an evening to remember!</p><p>With warm regards,</p><p> Rostomia Events Team</p>\"},\"multiple_dates\":false,\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"349035689667\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-09-17T21:53:07.605584Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":{\"ar\":{\"title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"description\":\"\"},\"en\":{\"title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"description\":\"\"},\"index\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\"},\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Naima Dziria\",\"start_date\":\"Sat, Nov 14, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":\"$101\",\"current_step\":\"success\",\"event_type\":\"seats\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":true,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":true},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":\"https://cdn-thumbnails.seatsio.net/region/eu/workspaceKey/84602b85-4af4-4edf-b274-8482d06cdf28/charts/eff433f3-b7f7-8517-ab95-6addb0927b5e/version/published/thumbnail/113\",\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/4730?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"موسيقى\",\"en\":\"Music\"},\"parent_id\":26,\"slug\":\"music\",\"label\":\"Music\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":939,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":1178772,\"label\":\"رويال نواب | Royal Nawaab\",\"slug\":\"royal-noab-royal-nawaab\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"رويال نواب\",\"en\":\"Royal Nawaab\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":{\"facebook\":\"\",\"whatsapp\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\"},\"latitude\":\"51.5345323\",\"longitude\":\"-0.3357709\",\"address\":\"7 Western Ave, Perivale, Greenford UB6 8DB, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-14T21:37:49.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-15T13:34:49.000000Z\",\"user_id\":65410,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":{\"id\":1178772,\"place_id\":939,\"key\":\"eff433f3-b7f7-8517-ab95-6addb0927b5e\",\"name\":\"Royal Nawaab\",\"status\":\"PUBLISHED\",\"tags\":null,\"archived\":0,\"publishedVersionThumbnailUrl\":\"https://cdn-thumbnails.seatsio.net/region/eu/workspaceKey/84602b85-4af4-4edf-b274-8482d06cdf28/charts/eff433f3-b7f7-8517-ab95-6addb0927b5e/version/published/thumbnail/113\",\"draftVersionThumbnailUrl\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-15T13:34:39.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-05T14:35:22.000000Z\"}},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"11:30 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4518,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"تونس تغني 2\",\"en\":\"Tounes Tghanni 2\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>نتالالبربيؤؤلانننن</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>Tounes Tghanni 2</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/SlSAV6QB6hDAkvHutcwI9yuMwv5AiILXXV3w4V6x.jpg\",\"images\":{\"youtube\":{\"id\":\"22lBZpuyZxA\",\"link\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/22lBZpuyZxA\",\"resource\":\"\"},\"instagram_story\":\"images/f3TuMXdGe1x3HZMNlfj3iScMfeyqvxvQPq97WELk.jpg\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"The Royal Regency 501 High St N, London E12 6TH\",\"en\":\"The Royal Regency 501 High St N, London E12 6TH\"},\"place_id\":878,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"tounes-tghanni-2\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-14 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-14 21:00\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":1,\"user_id\":50039,\"published\":1,\"private\":0,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T09:43:01.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[{\"pricing\":[{\"key\":\"oaBhIfJN9kL23I4r\",\"layout\":\"price_item\",\"attributes\":{\"fees\":4.8,\"price\":\"120\",\"category\":\"1\",\"fees_vat\":0,\"custom_data\":null,\"popover_info\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"fees_before_vat\":4.8}},{\"key\":\"Y5xvsFKO3MPETgve\",\"layout\":\"price_item\",\"attributes\":{\"fees\":3,\"price\":\"75\",\"category\":\"2\",\"fees_vat\":0,\"custom_data\":null,\"popover_info\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"fees_before_vat\":3}},{\"key\":\"wXXBAUX8gmah56ua\",\"layout\":\"price_item\",\"attributes\":{\"fees\":4,\"price\":\"100\",\"category\":\"3\",\"fees_vat\":0,\"custom_data\":null,\"popover_info\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"fees_before_vat\":4}}],\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"event_id\":\"435d41ee-8b84-4f58-825b-830b67263dd3\",\"gap_size\":\"0\",\"total_seats\":\"1430\",\"pricing_type\":\"simple\",\"ComputedField\":\"The Royal Regency - London\",\"additional_info\":\"<p>In step 1 of sales we want to allow only people book the whole table </p><p>at  £100 per seat </p>\",\"uploaded_file_name\":\"Select seating chart\",\"selected_pricing_type\":\"tiered\",\"uploaded_seating_chart\":\"\",\"limited_ticket_type_limit\":null,\"limited_ticket_type_keyword\":null,\"limited_ticket_type_message\":null}],\"rsvp\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":{\"AED\":371.96,\"AUD\":144.93,\"EUR\":90.2,\"GBP\":75,\"ILS\":321.28,\"JOD\":71.96,\"TRY\":5069.59,\"USD\":101.35},\"cta_label\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\",\"external_link\":\"\"},\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"seats\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"<p>🔥 <strong>بعد النجاح الكبير للنسخة الأولى</strong>، تقدم لكم <strong>Events by Khazri</strong> النسخة الثانية من <strong>تونس تغني 2</strong> في لندن! 🇹🇳🇬🇧</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">استعدّوا لليلة تونسية استثنائية تجمع بين نخبة من أبرز نجوم الفن التونسي، في أجواء مليئة بالموسيقى والطاقة والفرحة وروح تونس ❤️✨</p><p>🎤 <strong>نجوم الحفل:</strong></p><p>⭐ <strong>بلطي</strong> – نجم الراب التونسي الذي لا يحتاج إلى تعريف، بحضوره القوي وأغانيه التي صنعت أجواء لا تُنسى.</p><p>⭐ <strong>سمير لوصيف</strong> – أسطورة المزود، سيشعل المسرح بأجمل الأغاني والأجواء التونسية الأصيلة. 🔥</p><p>⭐ <strong>أمنة فاخر</strong> – صوت قوي ومميز، تضيف للحفل لمسة من الأناقة والإحساس والطرب التونسي الأصيل.</p><p>📅 <strong>التاريخ:</strong> السبت 14 نوفمبر 2026</p><p> 🕖 <strong>الساعة:</strong> 7:00 مساءً</p><p> 📍 <strong>المكان:</strong> The Royal Regency, 501 High St N, London E12 6TH</p><p>🎟️ <strong>لا تفوّتوا الموعد!</strong></p><p> ليلة تونسية بامتياز في قلب لندن، مع <strong>3 نجوم كبار على مسرح واحد</strong>.</p><p>🔥 <strong>احجزوا تذاكركم الآن واستعدّوا للغناء والرقص والاحتفال على الطريقة التونسية!</strong> 🇹🇳❤️🇬🇧</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>🔥 <strong>AFTER THE SUCCESS OF THE FIRST EVENT</strong>, Events by Khazri presents <strong>TOUNES TGHANNI 2</strong> — a spectacular Tunisian night in London! 🇹🇳🇬🇧</p><p>Get ready for an unforgettable evening bringing together some of Tunisia’s most loved artists, with music, energy and the spirit of home all under one roof. ✨</p><p>🎤 <strong>Featured artists:</strong></p><p>⭐ <strong>Balti</strong> – Tunisia’s iconic rap star, bringing his signature sound and unstoppable energy.</p><p>⭐ <strong>Samir Loussif</strong> – Mezoued legend bringing the heat and authentic Tunisian vibes to the stage. 🔥</p><p>⭐ <strong>Emna Fakher</strong> – A powerful and captivating voice bringing elegance, emotion and pure Tunisian artistry.</p><p>📅 <strong>Date:</strong> Saturday, November 14, 2026</p><p> 🕖 <strong>Time:</strong> 7:00 PM</p><p> 📍 <strong>Location:</strong> The Royal Regency, 501 High St N, London E12 6TH</p><p>🎟️ <strong>DON’T MISS OUT!</strong></p><p> A special Tunisian night in London with <strong>three exceptional artists</strong> — <strong>GRAB YOUR TICKET NOW</strong> and get ready to sing, dance and celebrate together! 🇹🇳❤️🇬🇧</p>\"},\"language\":\"dual\",\"fees_shares\":{\"buyer\":\"0\",\"option\":\"organizer_all\",\"organizer\":\"100\"},\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"<p><strong>🎟️ فئات التذاكر</strong></p><p>✨ GOLD<strong> – £120 للمقعد</strong></p><p> <strong>£100 للمقعد عند حجز طاولة كاملة لـ10 أشخاص</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-right ql-direction-rtl\\\">تشمل التذكرة:</p><ul><li>🪑 <strong>جلوس حول طاولة</strong> — الطاولات مخصصة لمجموعات من 10 أشخاص</li><li>🥤 <strong>مشروب غازي</strong></li><li>🍬 <strong>حلويات تونسية</strong></li><li>📍 <strong>الطابق الأرضي – المنطقة الرئيسية</strong></li></ul><p>⭐ SILVER <strong> – £100للمقعد</strong></p><ul><li>🪑 <strong>مقاعد فردية بدون طاولات</strong></li><li>📍 <strong>الطابق الأرضي – الجزء الخلفي</strong></li></ul><p>🌟 <strong>BRONZE – الشرفة</strong></p><ul><li>🪑 <strong>مقاعد مدرّجة</strong></li><li>📍 <strong>الطابق العلوي – الشرفة</strong></li></ul><p>🔥 <strong>اختاروا فئة التذاكر التي تناسبكم واحجزوا مبكراً لضمان أفضل المقاعد!</strong> 🇹🇳❤️🇬🇧</p>\",\"en\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><br></span></p>\"},\"multiple_dates\":false,\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"342661484236\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":false,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":true,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-09-27T22:59:15.003029Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":{\"ar\":{\"title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"description\":\"\"},\"en\":{\"title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"description\":\"\"},\"index\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\"},\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Tounes Tghanni 2\",\"start_date\":\"Sat, Nov 14, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":\"$101\",\"current_step\":\"success\",\"event_type\":\"seats\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":true,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":true},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":\"https://cdn-thumbnails.seatsio.net/region/eu/workspaceKey/84602b85-4af4-4edf-b274-8482d06cdf28/charts/33731f83-5282-81cc-b08f-72e96f931c93/version/published/thumbnail/367\",\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/4518?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"موسيقى\",\"en\":\"Music\"},\"parent_id\":26,\"slug\":\"music\",\"label\":\"Music\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":878,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":1001304,\"label\":\"The Royal Regency 501 High St N, London E12 6TH\",\"slug\":\"the-royal-regency-london\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"The Royal Regency 501 High St N, London E12 6TH\",\"en\":\"The Royal Regency 501 High St N, London E12 6TH\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":{\"facebook\":\"\",\"whatsapp\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\"},\"latitude\":\"51.5501374\",\"longitude\":\"0.0475166\",\"address\":\"501 High St N, London E12 6TH, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T09:41:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T07:05:03.000000Z\",\"user_id\":50039,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":{\"id\":1001304,\"place_id\":878,\"key\":\"33731f83-5282-81cc-b08f-72e96f931c93\",\"name\":\"The Royal Regency - London\",\"status\":\"PUBLISHED\",\"tags\":null,\"archived\":0,\"publishedVersionThumbnailUrl\":\"https://cdn-thumbnails.seatsio.net/region/eu/workspaceKey/84602b85-4af4-4edf-b274-8482d06cdf28/charts/33731f83-5282-81cc-b08f-72e96f931c93/version/published/thumbnail/367\",\"draftVersionThumbnailUrl\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T07:04:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-05T14:35:22.000000Z\"}},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"11:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4997,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"النادي - حفلة الافتتاح\",\"en\":\"El Naadi Launch Party\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>النادي بيرجّع لكم دفا حفلات العيلة اللي كبرنا عليها، للي واحشهم الجو ده، وللي لسه ما عاشوهوش.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">زيتون مشكّل، ديبس، عيش بلدي (أيوه، عيش بلدي بجد!!)، ورق عنب محشي، طعمية ,باذنجان مخلل، ومعمول بالتمر.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">اللي هتاخدوه مع تذكرتكم:</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>-مزّة:</strong> متعملة بحب، من وصفات العيلة ومكوّنات جاية من منطقة SWANA.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>-المشروبات مفتوحة طول الليل (لحد ما الكمية تخلص)، بكحول وبدون كحول:</strong> استنوا نبيذ لبناني، ومشروبات شعير من غير كحول من مصر، وحاجات تانية كمان.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">موسيقى لايف من اتنين فنانين تحفة، بالتعاون مع <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/swanarecords/?hl=en-gb\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">SWANA Records</a>. متحمسين قوي إن معانا <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/vincentj_official/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Vincent J</a> , الفنان اللبناني اللي ساكن في لندن، والفنانة المصرية <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/layalmusic/?hl=en\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ليال</a>.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">شوفونا على <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/el.naadi/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">إنستجرام</a> وتابعوا رحلة النادي معانا.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">El Naadi </strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">brings the warmth of the family parties we grew up with to those who miss it and those who haven’t experienced it.</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">Your ticket includes:</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>-Mezze:</strong> Fully vegetarian and cooked with love, using family recipes and ingredients sourced from the SWANA region. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\">Mixed olives, dips, Egyptian bread (yes, real 3eish baladi!!), stuffed vine leaves, ta'ameya (Egyptian falafel), pickled aubergines &amp; maamoul (date cookies).</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>-Drinks flowing all night (whilst stocks last)</strong>, both boozy and booze-free: expect Lebanese wines, Egyptian non-alcoholic malt beverages &amp; more. There will also be the opportunity to purchase beverages to take home with you at the end of the event. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>-Live music</strong> from two incredible acts, in collaboration with <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/swanarecords/?hl=en-gb\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">SWANA records</a>. We're so excited to have London-based Lebanese artist <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/vincentj_official/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Vincent J </a>and Egyptian artist <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/layalmusic/?hl=en\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Layal</a>. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">El Naadi</strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\"> evenings are about joy; they’re a chance to celebrate all that our countries have to offer, in a space that feels like home and with people who feel like family. Come as you are. </span><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">We'd love to welcome you to the club.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">Check us out on</span><a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/el.naadi/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\"> Instagram</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\"> to follow the El Naadi journey. </span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">*Please arrive at 7pm. We will start serving food shortly after, so any late arrivals may miss out. If you don’t get any ta3meeya that’s on you, so no Arabic timing please 😉 </span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">*</span>Age Restriction: 18+ and ID may be required. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>*Tickets are strictly limited.</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/i6b7rpODwWgkwgBb8FR0Xledjr7yxABYO2uf74v5.png\",\"images\":{\"instagram_story\":\"images/2dRM5Jz3qZPc50tYYrZjLlczBc7nmAmvrRBv86uC.jpg\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"لا توستادورا\",\"en\":\"La Tostadora\"},\"place_id\":1010,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"el-naadi-launch-party\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-21 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-21 20:00\",\"ticket_types\":[{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"RegularTicket_0\",\"color\":null,\"index\":0,\"price\":\"55\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":\"2026-11-20 17:00\",\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"تذكرة عادية\",\"label_en\":\"Regular Ticket\",\"pay_free\":false,\"quantity\":\"40\",\"description\":null,\"hide_ticket\":false,\"pay_as_need\":false,\"max_quantity\":\"5\",\"sell_to_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"sell_end_date\":\"2026-11-20\",\"ticket_active\":true,\"description_ar\":\"\",\"description_en\":\"\",\"sell_from_date\":\"2026-10-25 12:00\",\"sell_from_time\":\"12:00 PM\",\"disable_selling\":false,\"exchange_prices\":{\"AED\":272.77,\"AUD\":106.28,\"EUR\":66.15,\"GBP\":55,\"ILS\":235.61,\"JOD\":52.77,\"TRY\":3717.7,\"USD\":74.32},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":\"2026-10-25\",\"ticket_type_name\":2,\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":null},\"ticket_type_name_other\":\"\"}],\"category_id\":20,\"user_id\":103452,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T15:43:20.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":{\"AED\":272.77,\"AUD\":106.28,\"EUR\":66.15,\"GBP\":55,\"ILS\":235.61,\"JOD\":52.77,\"TRY\":3717.7,\"USD\":74.32},\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"regular\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"dual\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"<p><strong>-١٨+ فقط</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-التذاكر محدودة قوي.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-كل أكلنا بيتحضّر في مطبخ بيتعامل مع الـ ١٤ نوع مسبّب حساسية الرئيسيين، منها الجلوتين والمكسّرات والسمسم والألبان والبيض. نقدر نقولكم كل طبق فيه إيه من مسببات الحساسية، بس مش نقدر نضمن إن أي طبق خالي تمامًا من أي آثار. من فضلكم قولولنا لو عندكم أي حساسية وقت الحجز.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>-Age Restriction: 18+ and ID may be required.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-Tickets are strictly limited.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-All our food is prepared in a kitchen that handles the 14 major allergens, including gluten, nuts, sesame, dairy and eggs. We can tell you which allergens are in each dish, but we can’t guarantee that any item is completely free from traces. Please let us know about any allergies when you book.</p>\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"358151939803\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":true,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-10-27T10:43:03.712398Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"El Naadi Launch Party\",\"start_date\":\"Sat, Nov 21, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":\"$74\",\"current_step\":\"success\",\"event_type\":\"regular\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":true,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":true},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/4997?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"أمسيات\",\"en\":\"Evenings\"},\"parent_id\":35,\"slug\":\"evenings\",\"label\":\"Evenings\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":1010,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"لا توستادورا | La Tostadora\",\"slug\":\"la-tostadora-la-tostadora\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لا توستادورا\",\"en\":\"La Tostadora\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5298765\",\"longitude\":\"-0.0567771\",\"address\":\"London E2 9RF, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T14:55:26.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-16T14:55:26.000000Z\",\"user_id\":103452,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-21\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-21\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"10:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":5082,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Performance | In the Presence of the Absent Bird\",\"en\":\"Performance | In the Presence of the Absent Bird\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>For this special ceremonial listening session as part of the programme <em>songs these jaws cannot hold</em>, <strong>Hoda Siahtiri</strong> will use her voice to trace the presence of something once tangible and within reach which now feels distant. Developed in 2026, in the midst of the war, this new work reflects on relationships with the land in Iran. It invites to a space of remembrance and attentive listening in a world under threat.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>The accompanying music is composed by <strong>Parisa Esfandiari</strong>.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Moving between poetry and song, and electronic sounds, the listening session is following a time travel through sounds that seem to disappear. The piece draws on the ceremonial dimensions from Hoda’s longterm research into and engagement with the&nbsp;Bakhtiari women’s songs.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>The work is created within Hoda’s artistic framework Salon Lavoir, through which she brings together her individual practice and her collaborations with other artists to create ritual and musical spaces.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>For this special ceremonial listening session as part of the programme <em>songs these jaws cannot hold</em>, <strong>Hoda Siahtiri</strong> will use her voice to trace the presence of something once tangible and within reach which now feels distant. Developed in 2026, in the midst of the war, this new work reflects on relationships with the land in Iran. It invites to a space of remembrance and attentive listening in a world under threat.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>The accompanying music is composed by <strong>Parisa Esfandiari</strong>.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Moving between poetry and song, and electronic sounds, the listening session is following a time travel through sounds that seem to disappear. The piece draws on the ceremonial dimensions from Hoda’s longterm research into and engagement with the&nbsp;Bakhtiari women’s songs.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>The work is created within Hoda’s artistic framework Salon Lavoir, through which she brings together her individual practice and her collaborations with other artists to create ritual and musical spaces.</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/SLjyIdMsujpXPMMWRYGmGB8DIWdgOU2I8WcJUkI5.jpg\",\"images\":{\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"place_id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"performance-in-the-presence-of-the-absent-bird\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-25 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-25 19:00\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":2,\"user_id\":59377,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T15:06:31.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":1,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":[],\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"rsvp\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"359665835766\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T14:06:01.262901Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Performance | In the Presence of the Absent Bird\",\"start_date\":\"Wed, Nov 25, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":null,\"current_step\":\"rsvp\",\"event_type\":\"rsvp\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":false},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/5082?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"فن\",\"en\":\"Art\"},\"parent_id\":32,\"slug\":\"art\",\"label\":\"Art\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"Mosaic Rooms | Mosaic Rooms\",\"slug\":\"mosaic-rooms-mosaic-rooms\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.4949507\",\"longitude\":\"-0.1952534\",\"address\":\"226 Cromwell Rd, London SW5 0SW, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"user_id\":59377,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-25\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-25\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"09:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4888,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Nafs - day rave series\",\"en\":\"Nafs - day rave series\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>Space, Body &amp; Power 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Sunday 29 November</p><p>3–11pm | The Living Womb</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Nafs day rave 001 lineup.&nbsp;</p><p>The rest happens in the room.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Performances by:</p><p>★ Zutana Hadaddeen</p><p>★ Younes Guilmot</p><p>★ Rahim El Habachi</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>DJ sets by:</p><p>★ Loris</p><p>★ Data Theif</p><p>★ Amr</p><p>★ Veil B2B ????</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Art installation by Kasra Jalilpour.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Hosted by our brilliant hosts, Adam Ali &amp; Rukan Ackani.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>When you need a softer pace, our chill zone brings contemporary بيت الشعر vibes. A space to settle into, talk, and take a breath between dances.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>An afternoon into evening of music, performance, art, and a few things we’re keeping to ourselves. What makes the day won’t all make it onto your feed. You’ll have to be there. 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Our space, our shared commitments:</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Mutual respect is non-negotiable. Respect each other’s boundaries, identities and personal space. No racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, harassment or discrimination. If you experience or witness harm, speak to our team.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We stand for trans rights, queer liberation and the safety of marginalised communities. We acknowledge the ongoing oppression of people of colour and respect the lived experiences that shape this space.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We reject genocide, authoritarianism, occupation and systems that uphold oppression. This space is for community, expression and collective care.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No personal photography or filming. Only our authorised media team may photograph or film, and only guests wearing wristbands consent to being photographed. Wristbands are optional. No wristband means no photos or filming.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No guest list. A ticket does not guarantee entry. Admission is at the discretion of our door staff.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Nafs comes from a longing to feel more at ease around each other as queer SWANA+ people. To meet without having to explain every part of ourselves, and to find connection at our own pace. Whether you arrive with friends or on your own, there’s room for you here. No pressure to perform belonging. Just space to be.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ This rave is self-funded and helps keep NAFS going. Your ticket makes it possible and supports what comes next. If the price is out of reach, message us privately for discounted tickets. We don’t want money to keep you from the dancefloor.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Look after each other.&nbsp;</p><p>See you in the room. 📿</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>Space, Body &amp; Power 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Sunday 29 November</p><p>3–11pm | The Living Womb</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Nafs day rave 001 lineup.&nbsp;</p><p>The rest happens in the room.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Performances by:</p><p>★ Zutana Hadaddeen</p><p>★ Younes Guilmot</p><p>★ Rahim El Habachi</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>DJ sets by:</p><p>★ Loris</p><p>★ Data Theif</p><p>★ Amr</p><p>★ Veil B2B ????</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Art installation by Kasra Jalilpour.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Hosted by our brilliant hosts, Adam Ali &amp; Rukan Ackani.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>When you need a softer pace, our chill zone brings contemporary بيت الشعر vibes. A space to settle into, talk, and take a breath between dances.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>An afternoon into evening of music, performance, art, and a few things we’re keeping to ourselves. What makes the day won’t all make it onto your feed. You’ll have to be there. 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Our space, our shared commitments:</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Mutual respect is non-negotiable. Respect each other’s boundaries, identities and personal space. No racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, harassment or discrimination. If you experience or witness harm, speak to our team.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We stand for trans rights, queer liberation and the safety of marginalised communities. We acknowledge the ongoing oppression of people of colour and respect the lived experiences that shape this space.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We reject genocide, authoritarianism, occupation and systems that uphold oppression. This space is for community, expression and collective care.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No personal photography or filming. Only our authorised media team may photograph or film, and only guests wearing wristbands consent to being photographed. Wristbands are optional. No wristband means no photos or filming.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No guest list. A ticket does not guarantee entry. Admission is at the discretion of our door staff.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Nafs comes from a longing to feel more at ease around each other as queer SWANA+ people. To meet without having to explain every part of ourselves, and to find connection at our own pace. Whether you arrive with friends or on your own, there’s room for you here. No pressure to perform belonging. Just space to be.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ This rave is self-funded and helps keep NAFS going. Your ticket makes it possible and supports what comes next. If the price is out of reach, message us privately for discounted tickets. We don’t want money to keep you from the dancefloor.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Look after each other.&nbsp;</p><p>See you in the room. 📿</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/gMb8PDiNBxyE3F6R0NRljzBE0CMIyXhJOY7myUSz.png\",\"images\":{\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"The living womb\",\"en\":\"The living womb\"},\"place_id\":982,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"nafs-day-rave-series\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-29 13:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-29 21:00\",\"ticket_types\":[{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"EarlyBird_0\",\"color\":null,\"index\":0,\"price\":\"15\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":null,\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"Early 