",\"longitude\":\"-0.0238715\",\"address\":\"Smeed Rd, Fish Island, London E3 2NR, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T18:31:02.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-05T18:31:02.000000Z\",\"user_id\":60871,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-29\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-29\",\"from_time_only\":\"03:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"11:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":5037,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"GAG\",\"en\":\"GAG\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p><strong>Friday 4 December · 10pm–4am · Colour Factory, Hackney Wick</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>What is GAG? It’s not a straight answer. It started as a friends group four years ago, and grew into one of London’s largest Arab communities. Now we’re throwing a party to celebrate.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>All welcome 🤍</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Some of the most exciting Arab and SWANA artists from London, Berlin and Barcelona for one night of Arabic pop, disco, house and techno.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Performances:</strong> Salma Zahore · Tarek Khwiss</p><p><strong>Music:</strong> Ashtattz · Tareq · DJ Aboalaa · Seksu · 3MR</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>We cover phone cameras at the door, so everyone can dance freely.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Six hours of music you won’t hear anywhere else in London!</p>\",\"en\":\"<p><strong>Friday 4 December · 10pm–4am · Colour Factory, Hackney Wick</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>What is GAG? It’s not a straight answer. It started as a friends group four years ago, and grew into one of London’s largest Arab communities. Now we’re throwing a party to celebrate.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>All welcome 🤍</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Some of the most exciting Arab and SWANA artists from London, Berlin and Barcelona for one night of Arabic pop, disco, house and techno.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Performances:</strong> Salma Zahore · Tarek Khwiss</p><p><strong>Music:</strong> Ashtattz · Tareq · DJ Aboalaa · Seksu · 3MR</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>We cover phone cameras at the door, so everyone can dance freely.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Six hours of music you won’t hear anywhere else in London!</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/vDJKSKMmvDTGCRDY9LC3I9PuTQKOMMVTIPh7PE8e.jpg\",\"images\":{\"youtube\":{\"id\":null,\"link\":null,\"resource\":\"\"},\"instagram_story\":\"images/WkLu9muqAzuGi8TuhvtBH1UvDG4QE99y5UHkKJBK.jpg\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"كولور فاكتوري\",\"en\":\"Colour Factory\"},\"place_id\":1016,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"gag\",\"from_date\":\"2026-12-04 20:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-12-05 02:00\",\"ticket_types\":[{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"Lowincome_0\",\"color\":null,\"index\":0,\"price\":\"12\",\"currency\